This Software ("the Rapidly SDK") is proprietary commercial software
of Rapidly Labs AS, a company incorporated in Norway. Use of the SDK
requires a valid Rapidly licence issued by Rapidly Labs AS. Without a
valid licence, the SDK operates in a watermarked demo mode that audibly
degrades its output.

By downloading, installing, or using the SDK you agree to the terms below.

This Agreement, together with any separate commercial agreement you
