9. TERMINATION AND SUSPENSION
   This Agreement terminates automatically upon expiry of your Rapidly
   licence, upon any material breach of this Agreement, or as specified
   in your separate commercial agreement with Rapidly Labs AS. For a
   subscription key, the licence also ends when the subscription is
   cancelled or lapses for non-payment. For an activation key, each
   unit's authorisation ends when it expires without renewal.

   Rapidly Labs AS may suspend or revoke a subscription or activation
   key on material breach of this Agreement, on non-payment, or where
   the key is being used in a way that threatens the security or
   integrity of the licensing service. While a key is suspended,
   revoked, or expired, the SDK produces watermarked output.

   Upon termination you must cease all use of the SDK and destroy all
   copies in your possession, except that devices already in the hands
   of your end users may continue to run the SDK in watermarked mode.

